# RESTLESS: the title offers START and HIGH SCORES (UP and DOWN move
# between them) and B goes back to the library. START opens the story (any
# button skips it), and the run opens with Old Gaunt already dead: the
# first soul round has one piece and one guardian. Gathering it raises him
# on the spot in the first half with 150 on the clock, the staff, no
# points, and one death on the skulls.
game restless
wait 5
expect state == 0
expect paused == 0
expect menu == 0
press DOWN
expect menu == 1
press A
expect state == 10
wait 30
press A
expect state == 0
press UP
expect menu == 0
press A
expect state == 1
wait 30
press A
expect state == 4
expect deaths == 1
expect pieces == 1
expect guards == 1
expect flames == 0
expect half == 0
expect score == 0
expect time == 150
expect weapon == 0
expect revivals == 0
# the pause menu works in the Low Glow too
press START
expect paused == 1
press START
expect paused == 0
cheat winspirit
wait 60
expect state == 5
wait 40
expect state == 2
expect revivals == 1
expect inv > 0
expect px == 72
expect py == 144
expect time == 150
# no saving a run: out to the library and back is the title
press START
expect paused == 1
test_pause 0
